- **P2** - app/src/test/kotlin/net/montycasa/roux/ui/lint/HiddenActionViolation.kt:42. The substring search can flag unrelated names such as `fun parseDropdownMenu(...)`; nested Kotlin block comments can also produce false positives because the blanker stops at the first `*/`.

